      "RC": "Candidate relative risk reduction RR=(R-Rs)/R divided by the largest available relative RR in the scenario candidate pool.",
      "TC": "Topology/context match: 1 for a generated candidate whose source case or scenario matches the evaluated scenario, 0 for a known mismatch, otherwise missing.",
